        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f3fb3a0-990f-42c5-b28b-63ac6390ab46).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent [REDACTED].\rThe targets are to be eliminated at the Gama Hospital in Hokkaido. The client has provided intel that these five individuals are connected to the underground group we were informed of during the mission at the Burg Al-Ghazali. Targets of interest include Ellinor Yasuda, a shrewd and cold biologist with access to classified Ether operations, and Dwyer G. Pitt, a former accountant to many criminal organisations.\rI will leave you to prepare, Agent [REDACTED].",
